Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:40.38,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}Knew this day would come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:44.05,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}We see the gathering rays spread away
