Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:55.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}We see the gathering rays spread away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:58.06,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur10}With the fortunes in our souls
